<title>USA: Perfumania Inc Q1 May 3 loss widens.</title>
<headline>Perfumania Inc Q1 May 3 loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMI 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $0.28     loss	 $0.16</p>
<p> Net loss		   2,039     loss	 1,190</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   7,196		    7,490</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q1 retail sales increased 28.9 percent to $23.4 million and wholesale sales surged 30.1 percent to $6.5 million. Total revenues were not immediately available.</p>
